## 模块间协作

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Router["Router"] --> Controller["Controller"]
    Controller --> Service["Service"]
    Service --> Model["Model"]
    Controller --> Relay["Relay"]
    Relay --> Kit["Relaykit"]
    Web["Web"] --> Router
```

